    <innerclass refid="class_gaze_1_1_blink_state_machine" prot="public">Gaze::BlinkStateMachine</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespace_gaze">Gaze</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>State machine for blink detection and synthetic click coordination. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Enforces the invariant that loss of tracking is never a blink, and initial cold boot or unconfirmed eye states cannot trigger clicks. A click strictly requires transitioning from actively tracked open eyes to closed eyes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
